        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix: hoist timer declaration to avoid TDZ ReferenceError in abortable delay",
        "body": "Related: #98464\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\n`finish()` closure references `timer` declared as `const` after `finish`. TDZ ReferenceError risk.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nHoist `timer` as `let` above `finish` so it is safely `undefined`.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo user-visible change. Eliminates fragile declaration-order dependency.\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Runtime terminal proof:**\n\n![screenshot](https://github.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/blob/proof-screenshots/pr-98137-proof.png?raw=true)\n\n- 5/5 tests passed (`async.test.ts`)",
